        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terence Fisher, Leopoldo Torre Nilsson\n- Companies: Hammer Films\n- Products: The Horror of It All\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Terence Fisher was born on 23 February 1904 and died on 18 June 1980.\n- Terence Fisher was a British film director who worked for Hammer Films.\n- Leopoldo Torre Nilsson was born on 5 May 1924 and died on 8 September 1978.\n- Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, also known as Leo Towers and Babsy, was an Argentine film director, producer, and screenwriter.\n- The Horror of It All is a 1963 American horror comedy film directed by Terence Fisher.",
